    "body": "One thing remaining here is that if we want to have this check in at least three places, we should probably have an exported \"is an onion URL\" predicate that takes a URL and returns true or false instead. (Other things are tests, Mike's feedback, whether this should be optional somehow or conditional upon `.onion` support...)",
